OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fmostly fading during the evening, then
OL,7,Fbecoming largely dry overnight with
OL,8,Fclear spells and light winds, though a
OL,9,Ffew showers persisting along the
OL,10,Fcoasts. A notably chillier night than
OL,11,Fof late.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FMostly dry to begin Friday
OL,14,Fwith a good number of sunny spells.
OL,15,FSome showers developing during the
OL,16,Fafternoon from the north, but these
OL,17,Flighter and more isolated than on
OL,18,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
