OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FBecoming more settled into the outlook
OL,7,Fperiod with an increasing number of
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Small chance of a shower
OL,9,Fover the Cumbrian Fells on Sunday.
OL,10,FTemperatures below average for August.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
